fast	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.2	2026-10-23T14:58:18.1777099Z or maybe in a CI pipeline. Because of that, I'm going to skip the
fast	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.2	2026-10-23T14:58:18.1777508Z verbose output in the interest of brevity.
fast	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.2	2026-10-23T14:58:18.1777715Z 
fast	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.2	2026-10-23T14:58:18.1777803Z If you would like to
fast	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.2	2026-10-23T14:58:18.1778037Z see the output, try like this:
